---
source: crates/cli/tests/cli_output_snapshots.rs
expression: stdout
---
Game integration commands

Usage: wheelctl game [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list       List supported games
  configure  Configure game for telemetry
  status     Show game status
  test       Test telemetry connection
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json                 Output in JSON format for machine parsing
  -v, --verbose...           Verbose logging
      --no-mock              Fail if wheeld is unreachable instead of showing simulated data [env: WHEELCTL_NO_MOCK=1]
      --endpoint <ENDPOINT>  Service endpoint (for testing) [env: WHEELCTL_ENDPOINT=]
  -h, --help                 Print help
